the target language is: prolog.

the knowledge base hascapability includes these resources:
    lomo.

the knowledge base hascapability includes:

the text of the source description is at "sources/hasCapability.ttl".

% Who bears a duty: the agent of this role of the action (lomo.le).
the bearer role is addresser.


software eurobase is identified by "http://example.org/Software_EUROBASE".

software eurobase is a software.

software eurobase has the title "EUROBASE Statistical Database".

software eurobase has the capability "Store and retrieve statistical datasets".

software eurobase has the capability "Provide public access via web interface".

software eurobase has the capability "Export data in multiple formats (CSV, SDMX, JSON)".

software eurobase is published by agent eurostat.


software data validation is identified by "http://example.org/Software_DataValidation".

software data validation is a software.

software data validation has the title "Statistical Data Validation System".

software data validation has the capability "Validate incoming data against predefined rules".

software data validation has the capability "Generate validation reports".

software data validation has the capability "Flag anomalies for manual review".


% Things the description names but does not describe: their addresses.
agent eurostat is identified by "http://example.org/Agent_Eurostat".


